{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"I remember the specific, hollow thud when her trowel hit the frozen earth, searching for pockets of warmth. She didn't curse at the grey fuzz or the brown pellets; she simply leaned on the iron spike of the shovel and watched them hop toward the meadow with an efficiency that bordered on audacity. \"Let them have the west row,\" she would say, tapping ash from her cigarette onto the mulch. \"I planted the east for myself, and the north for the birds.\" It was a negotiation with nature she conducted with the calm of a chess master, knowing that if she yielded half, the other half would survive to be picked in the heat of August.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461092,"id":"chatcmpl-18e019ddf932e7040071","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320],"kept_max":248320,"kept_mean":248320.0,"kept_median":248320,"kept_min":248320,"kept_single":0,"mode":"sampled","p_repeat":2.081951981778